raft
====

This crate is a port to Rust of etcd raft (go.etcd.io/raft/v3),
https://github.com/etcd-io/raft, at commit
c51f010c851edd0dada5af41bafbf68e54617767.

etcd raft is Copyright The etcd Authors and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The text of the licence is in the LICENSE file.

What was changed: the Go source was translated to Rust file by file. Go's
names, order and control flow are kept; names are written in Rust's case
(MaybeUpdate is maybe_update). Each source file says which Go file it ports.
The comments of the Go source are carried over.

What was left out:
- node.go's goroutine-based Node. The port stops at RawNode, the
  single-threaded core that Node wraps.
- state_trace.go, the build-tagged TLA+ trace hooks.
- The generated protobuf code (raftpb/raft.pb.go). The messages are plain
  Rust structs that follow raft.proto.
- Go's unit tests. The datadriven test files under testdata/ are carried
  unchanged; see testdata/PROVENANCE.md.
